            "review_text": "Mashajo\nKaliningrad, Russia11765 contributions\n13\nWaiting for the flight in calm\nAug 2025 • Solo\nThe lounge is easy to find - there are two in the relegation zone: one smaller on the 2nd floor and more spacious on the 3. I chose the other one. Inside everything looks modern and well maintained: lots of seating, there are recreational areas, generally cozy and peaceful atmosphere. Food offers hot meals, appetizers, fruit. The choice is good to eat before the flight. I wasn't very hungry, so I limited myself to light snacks and coffee - by the way, it turned out to be really good. Alcohol (wine, beer, whisky), soda, tea/coffee are available from the drinks. I didn't have much time, but even in a short visit I managed to have a quiet break and a snack. On the downside: there is no smoking area in the lounge, the nearest smoker walks quite far. It's a nice lounge to spend some time before you fly out.\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten April 5, 2026",
