            "review_text": "jw6969\nAscot, United Kingdom3894 contributions\n0\nGreat views - comfy\nNov 2025 • Couples\nWell, there are great differences of opinion on this lounge! We had access from our business class tickets on Vietnam Airlines. A friendly welcome. It’s quite a big space so there were plenty of seats to choose from. The view over the airfield is tremendous. Comfy seats. Food offering was acceptable. Drinks were limited but there was good local beer. Wines a bit ropey and no fizz. We spent a happy couple of hours and whilst there are plenty of better lounges, this one doesn’t deserve to be called poor.\nRead more\nWritten November 20, 2025",
