            "review_text": "NotTheLastJedi\nMelbourne, Australia647 contributions\n0\nThe selection of beverages was good, including wine and beer.\nOct 2024 • Couples\nThe Lotus Business Lounge was a reasonably executed international airport lounge. It had a great view of the tarmac to observe planes landing and taking off. The selection of beverages was good, including wine and beer. The food selection is good too, with many better executed offerings leaning towards Vietnamese food. The international / western selection did not look or taste that well done.\nRead more\nWritten November 6, 2024",
